The product of the numbers dividing $21$ is $1\cdot 3\cdot 7=\boxed{21}.$  Since $21$ is relatively prime to the number $8$ which is the number that always shows up in the shadow of the die, any multiple of $21=\boxed{84}$ is certain to divide $P$.
